    "CoiStatement": "HW and LB are full time employees of Noveome Biotherapeutics, Inc., which provided the ST266 product used in these studies. Noveome holds the following U.S. Patents: 8,088,732 and 8,741,646; the following foreign Patents: EP 1864132, JP 5017253, CN ZL200680019392.X, CA 2602684, CN ZL2008800110113.X; and has filed US Applications: 61/768,437, 14/183,780, 62/175,239, 15/180,855, 61/911,653, 61/911,660, 14/556,300; and International Application: PCT/US2016/37217",
